00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:46.760
I committed adultery three times.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:53.740
Can you be more precise?

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:54.480
Eh?

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:57.100
What exactly did you do?

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:59.980
I stole three pennies out of my mum's purse.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:03.390
Oh, no, that's the next sin, isn't it? The funny one.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:04.410
Anything else?

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:08.200
I committed an immortal sin.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.440
A mortal sin? How?

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.910
I didn't go to Mass last Sunday.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.290
Ah, well, you will or something?

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:15.730
Marge wouldn't come with me.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:16.910
Is Marge your sister?

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.260
No, she's my mum. Everybody knows that.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.470
Oh, what about your father? Doesn't he go to church?

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:23.550
My dad?

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:24.470
Yes, your dad.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.460
Came to my First Communion.

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:27.840
Not otherwise.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.960
He says the next time he comes, it'll...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:45.130
be in a bleeding box father. Is he a Catholic? No father. Is he a believer then? No he's

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:55.440
a bus driver. Well now for your penance I want you to go to our lady's altar and say

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:59.980
one our father and one hail Mary for your mother and father and make a good act of contrition.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:06.250
while i give you absolution oh my god because they are so good i am very sorry that i have

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:10.170
sinned against the beach and with the help of thy grace i will not sin again day in day

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:17.330
go in peace dear and pray for me

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:41.550
How long is it since your last confession?

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:43.480
How long?

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:45.730
Oh, goodbye, dear.

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:48.370
What are your sins?

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:50.430
Oh, why don't you mind your own business?

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:51.250
Leave!

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:03.420
There was a lady run out of the church just now in a terrible panic.

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:05.020
I didn't say a word to her, Father.

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:07.580
Oh, I'm delighted. She's an absolute pest.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:08.660
Good.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:12.190
And I saw a little boy come out of the box, radiant,

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.330
as if you'd given him an ice cream or something.

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:15.350
I didn't, Father.

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:19.860
Well, anyway, you've passed your test with flying collars.

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:22.280
Oh, thank you, Father, very much.

00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:23.760
Father Neil.

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:24.540
Yes, Father?

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:29.900
May your stay at St. Jude's continue as happily.

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:31.770
as it's begun.
